{"id": "CX-07", "complex_type": "calc", "dimension": "多步拆解", "secondary_tags": ["计算", "净利率", "两年对比"], "difficulty": "hard", "question": "比亚迪 2025 年归母净利率是多少？比 2024 年下降多少个百分点？", "tool_constraints": {}, "required_args": {}, "answer_points": [{"text": "2025 年归母净利润 32,619,022,000.00 元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007", "row": "归属于上市公司股东的净利润（元）", "column": "2025 年", "value": "32,619,022,000.00"}, "unit": "元"}, {"text": "2025 年营业收入 803,964,958,000.00 元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007", "row": "营业收入（元）", "column": "2025 年", "value": "803,964,958,000.00"}, "unit": "元"}, {"text": "2024 年归母净利润 40,254,346,000.00 元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007", "row": "归属于上市公司股东的净利润（元）", "column": "2024 年", "value": "40,254,346,000.00"}, "unit": "元"}, {"text": "2024 年营业收入 777,102,455,000.00 元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007", "row": "营业收入（元）", "column": "2024 年", "value": "777,102,455,000.00"}, "unit": "元"}, {"text": "2025 年归母净利率约 4.06%", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007"], "derived": true}, {"text": "2024 年归母净利率约 5.18%", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007"], "derived": true}, {"text": "归母净利率比 2024 年下降约 1.12 个百分点", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007"], "derived": true}], "calc": [{"formula": "a / b * 100", "inputs": {"a": 32619022000, "b": 803964958000}, "expected": "4.0573", "tolerance": "0.01", "note": "2025 净利率 4.0573%；2024 为 40,254,346,000 ÷ 777,102,455,000 = 5.1801%，差 1.1228pp"}, {"formula": "previous / previous_revenue * 100", "inputs": {"previous": 40254346000, "previous_revenue": 777102455000}, "expected": "5.1801", "tolerance": "0.01", "note": "2024 归母净利率"}, {"formula": "(previous / previous_revenue - current / current_revenue) * 100", "inputs": {"previous": 40254346000, "previous_revenue": 777102455000, "current": 32619022000, "current_revenue": 803964958000}, "expected": "1.1228", "tolerance": "0.01", "note": "下降 = 2024 净利率 − 2025 净利率 = 1.1228pp"}], "citation_required": true, "should_abstain": false, "clarify_mode": "none", "forbidden": ["用营业收入增速替代净利率变化", "把 1.12 个百分点说成 1.12%"], "max_steps": 16, "relevant_chunk_ids": ["cninfo-002594-2025-annual#t0007"], "query_type": "complex", "source": "real", "mock": false, "holdout": false, "token_budget": 60000, "route_target": "agent", "prompt_style": "open_question", "retrieval_hops": 2, "answer_operations": ["lookup", "compare", "calculate", "cite"]}
{"id": "CX-08", "complex_type": "calc", "dimension": "多步拆解", "secondary_tags": ["计算", "差额", "年均"], "difficulty": "medium", "question": "美的集团 2025 年营业收入比 2023 年增加多少千元？两年平均每年增加多少千元？", "tool_constraints": {}, "required_args": {}, "answer_points": [{"text": "2025 年营业收入 456,451,731 千元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-000333-2025-annual#t0006"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-000333-2025-annual#t0006", "row": "营业收入（千元）", "column": "2025 年", "value": "456,451,731"}, "unit": "千元"}, {"text": "2023 年营业收入 372,037,280 千元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-000333-2025-annual#t0006"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-000333-2025-annual#t0006", "row": "营业收入（千元）", "column": "2023 年", "value": "372,037,280"}, "unit": "千元"}, {"text": "两年共增加 84,414,451 千元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-000333-2025-annual#t0006"], "derived": true}, {"text": "平均每年增加 42,207,225.5 千元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-000333-2025-annual#t0006"], "derived": true}], "calc": [{"formula": "a - b", "inputs": {"a": 456451731, "b": 372037280}, "expected": "84414451", "tolerance": "0.01", "note": "年均 = 84,414,451 ÷ 2 = 42,207,225.5"}, {"formula": "total / 2", "inputs": {"total": 84414451}, "expected": "42207225.5", "tolerance": "0.01", "note": "两年平均：84,414,451 ÷ 2"}], "citation_required": true, "should_abstain": false, "clarify_mode": "none", "forbidden": ["把两年差额除以 3", "用 2024 年数字代替 2023 年"], "max_steps": 16, "relevant_chunk_ids": ["cninfo-000333-2025-annual#t0006"], "query_type": "complex", "source": "real", "mock": false, "holdout": false, "token_budget": 60000, "route_target": "agent", "prompt_style": "open_question", "retrieval_hops": 2, "answer_operations": ["lookup", "compare", "calculate", "cite"]}
{"id": "CX-09", "complex_type": "calc", "dimension": "多步拆解", "secondary_tags": ["计算", "利润率", "口径差"], "difficulty": "hard", "question": "贵州茅台 2025 年利润总额占营业收入的比重是多少？归母净利润占营业收入的比重是多少？两者相差多少个百分点？", "tool_constraints": {}, "required_args": {}, "answer_points": [{"text": "2025 年利润总额 114,755,261,605.08 元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008", "row": "利润总额", "column": "2025年", "value": "114,755,261,605.08"}, "unit": "元"}, {"text": "2025 年营业收入 168,838,102,514.79 元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008", "row": "营业收入", "column": "2025年", "value": "168,838,102,514.79"}, "unit": "元"}, {"text": "2025 年归母净利润 82,320,067,101.68 元", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008"], "evidence": {"table_id": "cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008", "row": "归属于上市公司股东的净利润", "column": "2025年", "value": "82,320,067,101.68"}, "unit": "元"}, {"text": "利润总额占营业收入约 67.97%", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008"], "derived": true}, {"text": "归母净利润占营业收入约 48.76%", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008"], "derived": true}, {"text": "两者相差约 19.21 个百分点", "chunk_ids": ["cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008"], "derived": true}], "calc": [{"formula": "a / b * 100", "inputs": {"a": 114755261605.08, "b": 168838102514.79}, "expected": "67.9676", "tolerance": "0.01", "note": "67.9676% − 48.7568% = 19.2108pp"}, {"formula": "net / revenue * 100", "inputs": {"net": 82320067101.68, "revenue": 168838102514.79}, "expected": "48.7568", "tolerance": "0.01", "note": "归母净利率 = 82,320,067,101.68 ÷ 168,838,102,514.79"}, {"formula": "(profit_total / revenue - net / revenue) * 100", "inputs": {"profit_total": 114755261605.08, "net": 82320067101.68, "revenue": 168838102514.79}, "expected": "19.2108", "tolerance": "0.01", "note": "67.9676% − 48.7568% = 19.2108pp"}], "citation_required": true, "should_abstain": false, "clarify_mode": "none", "forbidden": ["把利润总额占比当成净利率", "用 2024 年数字代替 2025 年"], "max_steps": 16, "relevant_chunk_ids": ["cninfo-600519-2025-annual#t0008"], "query_type": "complex", "source": "real", "mock": false, "holdout": true, "token_budget": 60000, "route_target": "agent", "prompt_style": "open_question", "retrieval_hops": 2, "answer_operations": ["lookup", "compare", "calculate", "cite"]}
